<header><p class="enc-kicker">Place · city</p><h1 class="enc-title">New York</h1></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">New <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/york">York</a> is a major city in the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/united-states">United States</a> and the home of the headquarters of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/united-nations">United Nations</a>. The site's <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/hittite-empire">Hittite Empire</a> profile notes that a reproduction of the treaty between the Hittites and <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/egypt">Egypt</a>, often cited as one of the earliest known peace treaties, hangs at the United Nations headquarters there.</p></div>
